{"id":"n52125-1-7","stage":4,"title":"또래 · 同龄人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52125-1-7-1","ko":"난 또래끼리 지내는 게 편해.","zh":"我和同龄人相处会更自在。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"또래끼리","meaning":"同龄人，同辈人","explanation":"또래：同龄人，同辈人；끼리：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"또래","audio":"/audio/4fe3fde59d82864caed8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52125","senseId":"1","lemma":"또래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또래끼리","audio":"/audio/629fc8fe67dce5446221.mp3"}},{"text":"지내는","meaning":"相处，交往","explanation":"지내다：相处，交往；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"2","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내는","audio":"/audio/8f9fa3118f1c9aeaeaa3.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"편해.","meaning":"舒服，舒畅","explanation":"편하다：舒服，舒畅；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"1","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편해","audio":"/audio/864af6a351ea23198789.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4fe3fde59d82864c","term":"또래","zh":"同龄人，同辈人","audio":"/audio/4fe3fde59d82864caed8.mp3","entryId":"52125","definition":"年龄或水平相似的群体，或属于此群体的人。","pronunciation":["또래"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"相处，交往","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"与他人维持一定的关系过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"舒服，舒畅","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"身体或心情不难受，好。","pronunciation":["편하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/871eb146ffe5cda6616f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52125-1-7-2","ko":"나도. 수준이 비슷해서 말도 잘 통하잖아.","zh":"我也是。因为水平差不多，所以交流起来也很顺畅。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도.","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"수준이","meaning":"水准，水平","explanation":"수준：水准，水平；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수준","audio":"/audio/7a73f940083f5fda6132.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15767","senseId":"1","lemma":"수준","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수준이","audio":"/audio/3faad78a5d723cc00229.mp3"}},{"text":"비슷해서","meaning":"近似，接近，差不多","explanation":"비슷하다：近似，接近，差不多；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"비슷하다","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65864","senseId":"3","lemma":"비슷하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비슷해서","audio":"/audio/9fc91d8d5fa69dc95e13.mp3"}},{"text":"말도","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseI